## 🔧 Development Patterns

### Adding New Commands

#### Backend (Server)
1. Define command type in [CommandProcessor.js](mdc:backend-server/src/services/CommandProcessor.js)
2. Implement command handler with validation
3. Add security checks and audit logging
4. Test command execution and error handling

#### Frontend (Client)
1. Define command structure in [cloud/types.rs](mdc:src-tauri/src/cloud/types.rs)
2. Implement execution logic in [cloud/commands.rs](mdc:src-tauri/src/cloud/commands.rs)
3. Add security validation and error handling
4. Test integration with backend server

